int\": \"OPG degradation\"} Uncertainties: The exact molecular form of OPG is not fully resolved by the packet annotations, though the text clearly treats it as a degradable protein substrate. | The DTT comparison supports structure dependence but does not establish a separate mechanistic edge.", legacy_experiment_id: "", legacy_source_records: ""};
