ging/full_integration_v1. Not expert reviewed. {\"directness\": \"unknown\", \"intervention\": null, \"endpoint\": \"correlation with osteoclastogenesis and bone-resorbing activity\"} Uncertainties: This is a correlation, not a causal result. | The 'might be required' statement is a hypothesis rather than an observed mechanism.", legacy_experiment_id: "", legacy_source_records: ""};
