ource-anchored proposal; identity decisions and original uncertainties retained in data/staging/full_integration_v1. Not expert reviewed. {\"directness\": \"unknown\", \"intervention\": \"GSNOR activity/inhibition\", \"endpoint\": \"osteoclastogenesis\"} Uncertainties: The statement is a conclusion synthesized from the study rather than a single assay result. | The passage does not provide a direct mechanistic assay for denitrosation itself.", legacy_experiment_id: "", legacy_source_records: ""};
