ction", reviewed_at: "", review_note: "Automated source-anchored proposal; identity decisions and original uncertainties retained in data/staging/full_integration_v1. Not expert reviewed. {\"directness\": \"direct\", \"intervention\": \"high doses of sclerostin\", \"endpoint\": \"bone resorption\"} Uncertainties: The text links increased bone resorption to reduced trabecular bone volume, but the causal chain is described in prose rather than quantified in the excerpt. | The molecular form of sclerostin is inferred from context; the provider annotation labels it as a gene.", legacy_experiment_id: "", legacy_source_records: ""};
