l_integration_v1. Not expert reviewed. {\"directness\": \"unknown\", \"intervention\": \"tumor-derived CTHRC1\", \"endpoint\": \"osteoclast differentiation\"} Uncertainties: The passage links CTHRC1 to osteoclast differentiation and osteolytic lesions, but the exact causal chain to metastasis progression is not fully specified. | Species is supported only by the mention of mouse models; the molecular source of the CTHRC1 signal is tumor-derived, not explicitly a mouse or human protein.", legacy_experiment_id: "", legacy_source_records: ""};
