 \"unknown\", \"intervention\": \"Overexpression of GRB2; GRB2 expression reduced by shRNA or by gene inactivation\", \"endpoint\": \"activating phosphorylation of Src at Tyr-416; phosphorylation of cyt-PTPe at Tyr-638\"} Uncertainties: The passage also reports reciprocal effects from GRB2 reduction; they are summarized together as opposite results. | Direct physical binding is mentioned elsewhere in the abstract, but this claim is limited to required/causal activation effects.", legacy_experiment_id: "", legacy_source_records: ""};
